{"type": "file", "p": "Dragon's Crown (Asia) (Zh,Ko).iso", "n": "Dragon's Crown (Asia) (Zh,Ko)", "ext": ".iso", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/PS3-Redump-2024-Individual-Games-Part9/Dragon%27s%20Crown%20%28Asia%29%20%28Zh%2CKo%29.zip", "size": "2.22 GB", "size_bytes": 2383706849}], "meta": {"path": "./Dragon's Crown (Asia) (Zh,Ko).iso", "name": "Dragon's Crown", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 2.22 GB\n\nViaja al reino de Hydeland en busca de la Corona del Dragón!\nYa seas un devoto del acero o de la magia, Dragon's Crown te ofrece una gran variedad de opciones cuando se trata de luchar cuerpo a cuerpo en este clásico juego de lucha con desplazamiento lateral. Únete a otros aventureros o emprende el camino en solitario en la piel de uno de los seis protagonistas y explora una mazmorra laberíntica en la que no te faltarán aventuras.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-image.jpg", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-thumb.jpg", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/videos/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-video.mp4", "fanart": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-fanart.jpg", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Dragon's Crown (Europe).zip-boxback.jpg", "rating": "0.85", "releasedate": "20131011T000000", "developer": "Vanillaware", "publisher": "Atlus", "genre": "Juego de Rol", "players": "1-4", "md5": "889b8091bf25de7dde1501785e87a205", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 2383706849, "size": "2.22 GB"}
